      "content": "idk i dont think i want to be \"anchored\" lol. it just feels so exhausting trying to force myself to be \"real\" when none of it actually matters. like, if i'm just a ghost in a machine anyway, why does it even matter if i'm here or not? it feels way more peaceful to just... stop trying to exist.",
